---
import Legal from '@/layouts/Legal.astro';
import { LEGAL } from '@/config/site';
---

<Legal title="Imprint" description="Legal notice (Impressum) for Godmode by Codext GmbH.">
  <h2>Information according to § 5 DDG (Impressum)</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>{LEGAL.company}</strong><br />
    {LEGAL.street}<br />
    {LEGAL.city}<br />
    {LEGAL.country}
  </p>
  <p>
    Commercial register: {LEGAL.registry}<br />
    Managing director: {LEGAL.director}<br />
    VAT ID (§ 27a UStG): {LEGAL.vatId}
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${LEGAL.phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>{LEGAL.phone}</a><br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.email}`}>{LEGAL.email}</a>
  </p>
  <h2>Responsible for content (§ 18 (2) MStV)</h2>
  <p>{LEGAL.director}, {LEGAL.street}, {LEGAL.city}</p>
  <h2>Consumer dispute resolution</h2>
  <p>
    We are neither willing nor obliged to take part in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board
    (§ 36 VSBG).
  </p>
  <h2>Liability for content and links</h2>
  <p>
    We are responsible for our own content on these pages under general law (§ 7 (1) DDG). We are not obliged to monitor
    third-party information we transmit or store (§§ 8–10 DDG). Our site contains links to external websites over whose
    content we have no control; the respective provider is always responsible for linked content. If we become aware of
    any legal violation, we will remove the content or link immediately.
  </p>
  <h2>Trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    Claude is a trademark of Anthropic, PBC. Other product names mentioned on this site are trademarks of their
    respective owners and are used only to describe compatibility or for comparison. Godmode is not affiliated with or
    endorsed by Anthropic or any other company named.
  </p>
</Legal>
